<TD>means the VIE, Beijing Cheche Technology Co., Ltd., and its subsidiaries, Cheche Insurance Sales&nbsp;&amp; Services Co., Ltd., Huicai Insurance Brokerage Co., Ltd. and Cheche Zhixing (Ningbo) Car Service Co., Ltd. </TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
