<TR VALIGN="TOP">
<TD WIDTH="38%"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:2%; text-indent:-2%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;Aggregate Capital Raised&#148; </P></TD>
<TD>means the gross proceeds raised from the portion of the potential PIPE Investment, if any, that was procured through the efforts led by Prime Impact, its affiliates and/or representatives.</TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR VALIGN="TOP">
<TD WIDTH="38%"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:2%; text-indent:-2%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;Ancillary Documents&#148; </P></TD>
<TD>means each agreement, document, instrument and/or certificate entered into in connection with the Business Combination Agreement or therewith and any and all exhibits and schedules thereto. </TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
