<TD>means the warrants to purchase Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares into which the CCT Warrants will convert at the Acquisition Merger Effective Time. </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
