price of the Prime Impact Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares of $10.44 per share on March 27, 2023. Cathleen Benko resigned from the board of directors on April&nbsp;28, 2022 and currently holds 20,000 Prime Impact Founder Shares; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
