Impact&#146;s officers, and directors would lose their entire investment. As a result, the Sponsor and Prime Impact&#146;s officers, and directors may have a conflict of interest in determining whether CCT is an appropriate business with which to
effectuate a business combination and/or in evaluating the terms of the Initial Business Combination; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
