investment in Prime Impact if an Initial Business Combination is not completed within 24&nbsp;months from the Combination Period, as may be extended pursuant to the Existing Organizational Documents. On March&nbsp;8, 2023, the shareholders of Prime
Impact approved an additional amendment to the Existing Organizational Documents to extend the date by which Prime Impact has to consummate its initial business combination for up to an additional six months to September 14, 2023; and
