Share will be canceled and converted automatically, on a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">one-for-one</FONT></FONT> basis into one Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Share; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
