from the Conversion) and (y)&nbsp;held in CCT&#146;s treasury, will be canceled and converted into the right to receive a number of Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares based on the Per Share Merger Consideration; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
