ordinary share of the Surviving Subsidiary Company. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">For more information about the Business Combination Agreement and
the Business Combination and other transactions contemplated thereby, see &#147;The Business Combination.&#148; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Ownership Structure </I></B></P>
