STYLE="white-space:nowrap">than&nbsp;one-for-one;&nbsp;(2)&nbsp;vote</FONT></FONT> all Prime Impact Founder Shares held by them in favor of the adoption and approval of the Business Combination Agreement and the Transactions; (3)&nbsp;waive, for no
