Impact Units into the underlying Public Shares and warrants prior to exercising your redemption rights with respect to the Public Shares; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
