circumstances. To liquidate your investment, therefore, you may be forced to sell your Public Shares or the Public Warrants, potentially at a loss. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
