 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B><A NAME="rom450799_8"></A>SUMMARY FINANCIAL DATA OF PRIME IMPACT </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following table sets forth selected historical financial information derived from Prime Impact&#146;s (1) audited financial statements
