Impact Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares held by them in connection with a shareholder vote to approve the Business Combination; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
