<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">the fact that Prime Impact&#146;s independent directors and advisors own an aggregate of 80,000 Prime Impact
Founder Shares that were transferred from the Sponsor at their original purchase price, or approximately $0.003 per share, or $231.92, which if unrestricted and freely tradeable would be valued at approximately $835,200, based on the most recent
closing price of the Prime Impact Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares of $10.44 per share on March 27, 2023. Cathleen Benko resigned from the board of directors on April&nbsp;28, 2022 and currently holds 20,000 Prime Impact Founder Shares;
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
