<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">each then issued and outstanding Prime Impact Class A Ordinary Share and Prime Impact Class B Ordinary Share will
be canceled and converted automatically, on a one-for-one basis into one Class A Ordinary Share; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
