Prime Impact who have demanded properly in writing dissenters&#146; rights for such Prime Impact Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares or Prime Impact Class B Ordinary Shares, as applicable, shall be canceled and cease to exist in consideration for the right
to receive payment of such shares as provided in the Business Combination Agreement. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On the Closing Date and
