<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Agreement will be equitably adjusted for share splits, share dividends, reorganizations, recapitalizations, reclassifications, combination,
