the Business Combination Agreement, (ii)&nbsp;the issuance of shares of CCT ordinary shares (or other class of equity security of CCT, as applicable) pursuant to the terms of the CCT Preferred Shares and CCT Warrant, in each case, in effect on the
date of the Business Combination Agreement, in each case, will not require the consent of Prime Impact, or (iii)&nbsp;the issuance of Equity Securities of CCT pursuant to a Permitted Equity Financing, in each case as defined under the Business
