would not be voted in favor of approving the Business Combination (see this section for such representation and &#147;Risk Factors&#151;Risks Related to Prime Impact&#151;The Sponsor or Prime Impact&#146;s directors, officers, advisors or any of
their respective affiliates may elect to purchase Prime Impact&#146;s Public Shares from Public Shareholders, which may have the effect of increasing the likelihood of completion of the Business Combination or may reduce the public &#147;float&#148;
of the Class A Ordinary Shares.&#148;); </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">199 </P>

