they possess redemption rights, such rights were waived (See &#147;The Business Combination &#151;Related Agreements &#151;Sponsor Support Agreement.); and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
