purchase Prime Impact Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares in the open market, and (iv) full exercise of assumed CCT Options, and (b)&nbsp;do not take into account (i) HoldCo Warrants that will remain outstanding following the Business Combination and may
be exercised at a later date, and (ii) 63,552 Class A Ordinary Shares underlying the assumed Innoven Warrant and 1,002,276 unvested Exchanged Restricted Shares. The ownership percentage set below does include the Prime Impact Founder Shares, which
will convert into Class A Ordinary Shares upon the Initial Merger. As a result of the Business Combination, the economic and voting interests of Prime Impact&#146;s shareholders will decrease. </P>
