<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Each Prime Impact Warrant, outstanding and unexercised immediately prior to Initial Merger Effective Time,
shall be assumed by HoldCo and converted into a warrant to acquire one Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Share, subject to same terms and conditions. The Prime Impact Warrants consist of both private placement warrants and public warrants. Pursuant to the
Sponsor Support Agreement, immediately prior to the Initial Merger, 2,860,561 of the private placement warrants shall be forfeited for no consideration. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At the Acquisition Merger Effective Time, all the property, rights, privileges, immunities, powers, franchises, licenses and authority of CCT
and Merger Sub shall vest in the HoldCo, and all debts, liabilities, </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">307 </P>

</DIV></Center>


