shall be cancelled in exchange for the right to receive the number of Class&nbsp;B Ordinary Shares based on the applicable Per Share Merger Consideration. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
