<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">assuming a scenario of no redemption and no exercise of dissent rights from Prime Impact and CCT shareholders,
the total number of HoldCo Ordinary Shares expected to be outstanding after the Business Combination is 84,131,571, consisting of (1) 75,150,652 Ordinary Shares to be issued to CCT&#146;s shareholders, assuming full exercise of the assumed CCT
Options, (2) 4,639,867 Class A Ordinary Shares to be issued to Public Shareholders of Prime Impact, and (3) 4,341,052 Class A Ordinary Shares to be issued to the Sponsor; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
