<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">assuming a scenario of maximum redemption and no exercise of dissent rights from Prime Impact and CCT
shareholders, the total number of HoldCo Ordinary Shares expected to be outstanding after the Business Combination is 79,491,704, consisting of (1) 75,150,652 Ordinary Shares to be issued to CCT&#146;s shareholders, assuming full exercise of the
assumed CCT Options, and (2) 4,341,052 Class A Ordinary Shares to be issued to the Sponsor. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The above calculation of
Ordinary Shares expected to be outstanding upon the completion of the Business Combination excludes 63,552 Class A Ordinary Shares underlying the assumed Innoven Warrant and 785,796 unvested Exchanged Restricted Shares, and assumes no exercise of
HoldCo Warrants covering an aggregate of 13,663,365 Class A Ordinary Shares converted from 10,802,804 Prime Impact Public Warrants and 2,860,561 Prime Impact Private Placement Warrants. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">335 </P>

