expire on June&nbsp;4, 2022 to support its operations, which was guaranteed by Cheche Insurance Sales &amp; Service Co., Ltd. and Mr.&nbsp;Lei Zhang. There are no financial covenants for the credit facility. The interest is payable on a quarterly
basis and the principal will be due upon maturity. Under the credit facility, CCT drew down RMB5.0 million and RMB5.0 million on May&nbsp;28, 2021 and June&nbsp;3, 2021, respectively. They were fully repaid in May and June 2022. Subsequently, CCT
drew down RMB10.0 million on June&nbsp;30, 2022, which was fully repaid on July 15, 2022. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">340 </P>

