<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B>NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&nbsp;(CONTINUED) </B></P>
