<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Cancelation of ordinary shares </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In January 2019, in connection with the Reorganization, the Company issued 35,711,000 and 39,289,000 ordinary shares to Fuze Yue Ltd. and Tank
Stone Ltd., respectively. Fuze Yue Ltd. and Tank Stone Ltd. hold such shares as the nominee of the Company pursuant to the 2019 Incentive Plan. In January 2020, the Company canceled 35,711,000 ordinary shares of Fuze Yue Ltd. to adjust the size of
incentive award pool under the 2019 Incentive Plan. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
