shares equals or exceeds $18.00 per share (as adjusted for share <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">sub-divisions,</FONT> share capitalizations, reorganizations, recapitalizations and the like) for any 20 trading days within <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">a&nbsp;30-trading&nbsp;day</FONT> period ending on the third trading day prior to the date on which the Company sends the notice of redemption to the warrant holders (the &#147;Reference Value&#148;).
