STYLE="white-space:nowrap">sub-divisions,</FONT> share dividends, reorganizations, recapitalizations and the like); and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
