Kong, the Macau Special Administrative Region and Taiwan. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><U>Privacy Laws</U></B>&#148; means all Laws related to data privacy,
data security, cybersecurity or national security that govern the receipt, collection, use, storage, processing, sharing, security, disclosure, or transfer of Personal Information. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><U>Processing</U></B>&#148; means the receipt, collection, compilation, use, storage, processing, sharing, safeguarding, security,
disposal, destruction, disclosure, or transfer of information. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B><U>Products</U></B>&#148; mean any products or services,
