reasonably be expected to have a Company Material Adverse Effect. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(b) <B><U>Agreements and Covenants</U></B>. The Company
