the Company (or if earlier, the Outside Date). </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(c) <B><U>No Material Adverse Effect</U></B>. Since the date of this
