and <U>Section</U><U></U><U>&nbsp;8.02(c)</U>. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><U>8.03</U> <U>Conditions to the Obligations of the Company</U><U></U>. </B>The
