<TD>means an Ordinary Share of a par value of US$0.00001 in the capital of the Company, designated as a Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares and having the rights provided for in these Articles; </TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
