<TD>means the Companies Act (2022 Revision) of the Cayman Islands and any statutory amendment or <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">re-enactment</FONT> thereof; </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
