<TD>means ZHANG Lei (<FONT STYLE="font-family:pmingliu; font-size:9pt">&#24352;&#30922;</FONT>), the founder of the Company. </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
