<TD>means a communication sent by electronic means, including electronic posting to the Company&#146;s Website, transmission to any number, address or internet website (including the website of the Commission) or other electronic delivery methods as
otherwise decided and approved by not less than <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">two-thirds</FONT> of the vote of the Board; </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
