<TR VALIGN="TOP">
<TD WIDTH="38%"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:2%; text-indent:-2%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>&#147;Securities Act&#148; </B></P></TD>
<TD>means the Securities Act of 1933 of the United States of America, as amended, or any similar federal statute and the rules&nbsp;and regulations of the Commission thereunder, all as the same shall be in effect at the time; </TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
<TR VALIGN="TOP">
<TD WIDTH="38%"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:2%; text-indent:-2%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>&#147;Share&#148; </B></P></TD>
<TD>means a share in the capital of the Company. All references to &#147;Shares&#148; herein shall be deemed to be Shares of any or all Classes as the context may require. For the avoidance of doubt in these Articles the expression &#147;Share&#148;
shall include a fraction of a Share; </TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
